{"h":3395,"lines":[{"y":0.046511627815394085,"t":"1718867188","w":0.069958845774332645,"h":0.008720930389296444,"c":0.30000001192092896,"x":0.7716049391467531},{"c":1,"x":0.42989596930463031,"y":0.093930351370973719,"t":"READING","w":0.12786238352457685,"h":0.018534645736568489},{"h":0.013250883392226132,"c":1,"t":"READING PASSAGE 1","y":0.15400471134213145,"x":0.10082304359551496,"w":0.28806584676106767},{"c":1,"w":0.76131688435872402,"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 1-13, which are based on Reading","x":0.1028806523648108,"h":0.015993508068214979,"y":0.1889534882261894},{"y":0.2049418603347376,"c":1,"x":0.10493826878694217,"t":"Passage 1 below.","w":0.15637860616048177,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"w":0.29629628499348964,"c":1,"y":0.24411071897498959,"h":0.018970675968309481,"t":"The Dead Sea Scrolls","x":0.34362140471802233},{"y":0.28343023241222975,"w":0.77572016398111976,"t":"In late 1946 or early 1947, three Bedouin teenagers were tending their goats and sheep","c":1,"x":0.098765432304966316,"h":0.016039732066986834},{"y":0.29941860451738778,"x":0.10288065713337934,"t":"near the ancient settlement of Qumran, located on the northwest shore of the Dead","w":0.73045267740885411,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.10279732158184914,"t":"Sea in what is now known as the West Bank. One of these young shepherds tossed a","w":0.75531778971354158,"y":0.31356730776835051,"h":0.017423115293325298},{"y":0.33274440523256188,"c":1,"t":"rock into an opening on the side of a cliff and was surprised to hear a shattering sound.","h":0.016195524146054296,"w":0.77160491943359366,"x":0.09876544141836803},{"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"w":0.72633743286132812,"x":0.10288066618250469,"y":0.34883720916963989,"t":"He and his companions later entered the cave and stumbled across a collection of"},{"x":0.098765437006494303,"y":0.36627906963455548,"t":"large clay jars, seven of which contained scrolls with writing on them. The teenagers","c":1,"w":0.74485595703124996,"h":0.014534883982160851},{"c":1,"w":0.76760208129882801,"h":0.016329613675498345,"t":"took the seven scrolls to a nearby town where they were sold for a small sum to a local","x":0.10077629473126279,"y":0.38167286189478467},{"y":0.39690902044015242,"w":0.76973078409830731,"t":"antiquities dealer. Word of the find spread, and Bedouins and archaeologists eventually","x":0.10073617272146711,"h":0.020280069681443802,"c":1},{"h":0.015988372380376759,"t":"unearthed tens of thousands of additional scroll fragments from 10 nearby caves;","w":0.71810699462890626,"x":0.10082304579354646,"y":0.41569767427102822,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.098765439629430976,"y":0.4316843344602489,"w":0.78395060221354174,"h":0.015990084276322869,"t":"together they make up between 800 and 900 manuscripts. It soon became clear that this"},{"h":0.017923761733990906,"t":"was one of the greatest archaeological discoveries ever made.","c":1,"y":0.44722899957735285,"w":0.55573766072591146,"x":0.10074380381385092},{"x":0.10082305363214374,"w":0.77777776082356787,"h":0.01453488398216074,"y":0.48255813940215586,"c":1,"t":"The origin of the Dead Sea Scrolls, which were written around 2,000 years ago between"},{"h":0.016007204359074878,"c":1,"x":0.10082305457291757,"w":0.77160491943359366,"t":"150 BCE and 70 CE, is still the subject of scholarly debate even today. According to the","y":0.49852767950308752},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"x":0.10082304736173597,"w":0.76337448120117202,"c":1,"t":"prevailing theory, they are the work of a population that inhabited the area until Roman","y":0.51590106021208415},{"c":1,"x":0.10082305699779359,"y":0.53052325603206774,"w":0.75308639526367183,"t":"troops destroyed the settlement around 70 CE. The area was known as Judea at that","h":0.016002068109590928},{"x":0.10288064795899374,"t":"time, and the people are thought to have belonged to a group called the Essenes, a","y":0.54796511614613996,"w":0.73456792195638021,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1},{"t":"devout Jewish sect.","h":0.014570836043610536,"c":1,"y":0.56537102454325827,"w":0.17901234944661459,"x":0.10082304327704401},{"y":0.59738372078171076,"h":0.01598837238037687,"x":0.10082304838097041,"t":"The majority of the texts on the Dead Sea Scrolls are in Hebrew, with some fragments","w":0.75720163981119792,"c":1},{"x":0.1008230564765743,"y":0.61482558126257703,"c":1,"h":0.01453488398216074,"t":"written in an ancient version of its alphabet thought to have fallen out of use in the fifth","w":0.75925923665364581},{"x":0.10074459245538776,"y":0.62817003774159685,"t":"century BCE. But there are other languages as well. Some scrolls are in Aramaic, the","w":0.75120442708333324,"h":0.020240274840445993,"c":1},{"t":"language spoken by many inhabitants of the region from the sixth century BCE to the","w":0.75308639526367194,"x":0.098765445578040581,"y":0.64680232579950958,"c":1,"h":0.016036307713449105},{"c":1,"y":0.66424418590042689,"t":"siege of Jerusalem in 70 CE. In addition, several texts feature translations of the Hebrew","h":0.01598837238037687,"w":0.78189300537109374,"x":0.10082304454101366},{"t":"Bible into Greek.","x":0.10263501986858775,"c":1,"h":0.015705774754320889,"w":0.1486902872721354,"y":0.67917011559533236},{"t":"The Dead Sea Scrolls include fragments from every book of the Old Testament of the","y":0.71366279056496484,"x":0.10288065424731693,"h":0.014546867815428799,"w":0.74897120157877606,"c":1},{"x":0.10288065958920072,"y":0.73110465103023226,"t":"Bible except for the Book of Esther. The only entire book of the Hebrew Bible preserved","h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"w":0.76954732259114589},{"x":0.10082305369294621,"c":1,"h":0.017479524735988794,"w":0.77777776082356775,"y":0.74705535913814913,"t":"among the manuscripts from Qumran is Isaiah; this copy, dated to the first century BCE,"},{"w":0.763586680094401,"t":"is considered the earliest biblical manuscript still in existence. Along with biblical texts,","h":0.020125012796534558,"y":0.76044611567590514,"c":1,"x":0.098675045196327277},{"c":1,"t":"the scrolls include documents about sectarian regulations and religious writings that do","w":0.76543207804361979,"h":0.014534883982160851,"x":0.10082305552466493,"y":0.78052325568133607},{"y":0.79651162774332773,"w":0.29218106587727866,"x":0.10082304736439099,"h":0.01453488398216074,"c":1,"t":"not appear in the Old Testament."},{"t":"37","x":0.8580246914705375,"w":0.024691357612609877,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.86773255796252025,"c":1},{"h":0.03375352650564889,"y":0.95314993796778535,"w":0.30612678527832038,"c":1,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","x":0.66991655033568553}],"w":2400}